[00:25.47] When you pulled her underground
[00:29.08] There is no fire in your glass eye
[00:32.51] There is no feeling when you're done
[00:35.71] And one day you will find out
[00:39.25] What kind of monster you've become
[00:43.24] Were you ever thinking
[01:00.72] When you pulled her off the bus
